    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/759f06d7eb607286b60c8cbf7931bc56.avif?t=1752272041\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Slime Survivors&quot; \u2013 Survive the Limitless Monster Onslaught!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As endless hordes of demons swarm like tidal waves, you\u2019ll become a hero of the Slime Kingdom, upgrading <strong>diverse weapons</strong> to forge instruments of carnage! Dodge through bullet-hell barrages, unleash dazzling ultimate skills to shred enemy waves, and experience an adrenaline-pumping roguelike survival frenzy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do: Move your character, aim at enemies, evade attacks, collect rewards, power up, and slaughter foes in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.poster.avif?t=1752272041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.webm?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.mp4?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.poster.avif?t=1752272041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.webm?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.mp4?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.poster.avif?t=1752272041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.webm?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.mp4?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 <strong>Thrilling Combat Mastery</strong> \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A transformative weapon upgrade system turns your humble beginnings into apocalyptic god-slaying artillery! Every level-up brings explosive power growth\u2014witness the miracle of a nobody becoming an apocalyptic force!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 <strong>Push Your Limits</strong> \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge! Strategize! Survive! Find loopholes in increasingly chaotic bullet-hell storms and break through suffocating waves with precision. Every second you survive is a triumph of skill and luck!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221a <strong>Endless Variety</strong>: Mix and match dozens of weapons and gear<br>\u221a <strong>Visual Spectacle</strong>: A full-screen spectacle of explosive effects.<br>\u221a <strong>Challenging Mayhem</strong>: Strike a perfect balance between dodging and slaying your enemies.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/759f06d7eb607286b60c8cbf7931bc56.avif?t=1752272041\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Slime Survivors&quot; \u2013 Survive the Limitless Monster Onslaught!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As endless hordes of demons swarm like tidal waves, you\u2019ll become a hero of the Slime Kingdom, upgrading <strong>diverse weapons</strong> to forge instruments of carnage! Dodge through bullet-hell barrages, unleash dazzling ultimate skills to shred enemy waves, and experience an adrenaline-pumping roguelike survival frenzy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do: Move your character, aim at enemies, evade attacks, collect rewards, power up, and slaughter foes in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.poster.avif?t=1752272041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.webm?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/ff97134921a71de9997e3947bcafaac0.mp4?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.poster.avif?t=1752272041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.webm?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/b7e784278bd7a42efaac3659a002e5c3.mp4?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.poster.avif?t=1752272041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.webm?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/fe8acd4128d559d2f4d6c3ee6452f34b.mp4?t=1752272041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 <strong>Thrilling Combat Mastery</strong> \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A transformative weapon upgrade system turns your humble beginnings into apocalyptic god-slaying artillery! Every level-up brings explosive power growth\u2014witness the miracle of a nobody becoming an apocalyptic force!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 <strong>Push Your Limits</strong> \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge! Strategize! Survive! Find loopholes in increasingly chaotic bullet-hell storms and break through suffocating waves with precision. Every second you survive is a triumph of skill and luck!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221a <strong>Endless Variety</strong>: Mix and match dozens of weapons and gear<br>\u221a <strong>Visual Spectacle</strong>: A full-screen spectacle of explosive effects.<br>\u221a <strong>Challenging Mayhem</strong>: Strike a perfect balance between dodging and slaying your enemies.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aSlime Survivors\u300b is a vibrant bullet-hell hack-and-slash game where you cut through monster hordes, collect rewards to upgrade your weapons, and become an apocalyptic force on the Slime continent.",
